## Interface: 30300
## Title: |cff9966ffEbonOrbReroll|r
## Notes: Adds a "Reroll (Orb)" button under the Echo cards, spending one Orb of Lost Memories for a fresh draw, and hunts for chosen Echoes across repeated draws.
## Author: Sanavesa (fork maintained by Siphelis)
## Version: 1.2.0

# Order matters. The core defines the shared string table and the wishlist takes a
# reference to it at load, so the core has to come first. The dependency does not
# run the other way: the core reads ns.Wishlist at call time, never at load, so it
# cannot catch the second file half-built.
EbonOrbReroll.lua
EbonOrbWishlist.lua
